{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40650","headline":"乱後龙州送郑郎中兼寄郑侍御 · 李洞","name":"乱後龙州送郑郎中兼寄郑侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"待车登叠嶂，经乱集鴒原。\n省坏兰终洁，台寒栢有根。\n县清江入峡，楼静雪连村。\n莫隐匡山社，机云受晋恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}